{%- comment -%}
  A layout group — the one block that arranges other blocks.

  **This is the primitive the theme was missing.** Merchant blocks render as one
  flat sibling flow, so until now anything the design puts *side by side* could
  not be built from blocks at all: the products list's eyebrow and its "View
  All" share one `space-between` row, and as plain blocks they fell onto two
  lines. Every workaround for that was a section-specific rule in the
  stylesheet. A group replaces all of them with something a merchant can see and
  move.

  It belongs to no section. Any section that renders `{% content_for 'blocks' %}`
  can list `group`, and the group takes `@theme` — every theme block there is —
  so what goes inside it is the merchant's business, not the section's.

  **Horizontal is the default, deliberately.** Vertical is still useful when a
  merchant needs one movable column with its own alignment, spacing, borders,
  or equal-height children. Child sizing follows the direction: widths for a
  row and heights for a stack, so a hidden row value never stretches a column.

  **Responsive settings are horizontal-only and say so with `visible_if`**, rather
  than sitting in the panel doing nothing:

    - `gap` resolves to the horizontal space in a row. A stacked Group instead
      shows Stacked children spacing, whose default follows the section's
      vertical rhythm.
    - `wrap` is meaningless in a column: wrapping one needs a bounded height,
      and nothing here gives it one.
    - `stack_below` exists to turn a row into a column, so it has nothing to
      say to a group that already is one.
    - `content_alignment_mobile` only appears when that row is actually set to
      stack; otherwise there is no second layout to align.

  Content inside children inherits from the section unless the Group sets its
  own. That override is shown only when equal-width row children or full-width
  stacked children provide space in which alignment has a visible effect. The
  responsive choice inherits the desktop answer by default, and can replace it
  only inside the same container query that stacks the row.

  The children's own vertical margins are zeroed, the same way
  `.collection-list__content` zeroes them: a gap and a margin add, so a block
  carrying both would space itself twice. They keep those margins everywhere
  else, which is why this is done here rather than at the source.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  **Two elements, and that is not a wrapper for its own sake.** The group has
  to answer a question about its own width — "am I narrow enough to stack?" —
  and a container cannot be styled by a query against itself. So the outer
  element *is* the container and the inner one is the row that responds. This
  theme has hit that trap twice already, on `.row-carousel__frame` and on
  `.quick-view__frame`: put both on one element and it parses, uploads and
  silently never fires.

  A container query rather than a media query, deliberately. The group should
  stack when *it* is narrow — in a half-width column on a desktop just as much
  as on a phone — which is a question about the block, not the screen.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture group_content -%}{% content_for 'blocks' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{% render 'layout-group', layout_settings: block.settings, content: group_content, attributes: block.shopify_attributes %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.group.name",
  "tag": null,
  "blocks": [{ "type": "@theme" }, { "type": "@app" }],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "direction",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.direction.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.direction.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "horizontal", "label": "t:blocks.group.direction.horizontal" },
        { "value": "vertical", "label": "t:blocks.group.direction.vertical" }
      ],
      "default": "horizontal"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "distribute",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.distribute.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "start", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute.start" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute.center" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute.end" },
        { "value": "between", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute.between" }
      ],
      "default": "between",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "align",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.align.label_horizontal",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.align.info_horizontal",
      "options": [
        { "value": "baseline", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.text" },
        { "value": "start", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.top" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.middle" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.bottom" },
        { "value": "stretch", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.equal_height" }
      ],
      "default": "baseline",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "align_vertical",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.align.label_vertical",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.align.info_vertical",
      "options": [
        { "value": "start", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.centre" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.right" },
        { "value": "stretch", "label": "t:blocks.group.align.full_width" }
      ],
      "default": "start",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'vertical' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "distribute_vertical",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute_vertical.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.distribute_vertical.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "start", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute_vertical.start" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute_vertical.center" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute_vertical.end" },
        { "value": "between", "label": "t:blocks.group.distribute_vertical.between" }
      ],
      "default": "start",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'vertical' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_alignment",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.content_alignment.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.content_alignment.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "inherit", "label": "t:blocks.group.content_alignment.inherit" },
        { "value": "left", "label": "t:settings_schema.options.left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:settings_schema.options.center" },
        { "value": "right", "label": "t:settings_schema.options.right" }
      ],
      "default": "inherit",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'vertical' and block.settings.align_vertical == 'stretch' or block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' and block.settings.items_width == 'equal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "wrap",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.wrap.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.wrap.info",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "items_width",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.items_width.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.items_width.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "natural", "label": "t:blocks.group.items_width.natural" },
        { "value": "equal", "label": "t:blocks.group.items_width.equal" }
      ],
      "default": "natural",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "items_height",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.items_height.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.items_height.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "natural", "label": "t:blocks.group.items_height.natural" },
        { "value": "equal", "label": "t:blocks.group.items_height.equal" }
      ],
      "default": "natural",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'vertical' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "stack_below",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.stack_below.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.stack_below.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "never", "label": "t:blocks.group.stack_below.never" },
        { "value": "tablet", "label": "t:blocks.group.stack_below.tablet" },
        { "value": "mobile", "label": "t:blocks.group.stack_below.mobile" }
      ],
      "default": "mobile",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "content_alignment_mobile",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.content_alignment_mobile.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.content_alignment_mobile.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "inherit", "label": "t:blocks.group.content_alignment_mobile.inherit" },
        { "value": "left", "label": "t:settings_schema.options.left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "t:settings_schema.options.center" },
        { "value": "right", "label": "t:settings_schema.options.right" }
      ],
      "default": "inherit",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' and block.settings.stack_below != 'never' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.all.spacing_header",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.gap.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.gap.info",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'horizontal' }}",
      "options": [
        { "value": "none", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.none" },
        { "value": "minimal", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.minimal" },
        { "value": "tiny", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.tiny" },
        { "value": "small", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.small" },
        { "value": "medium", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.medium" },
        { "value": "large", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.large" },
        { "value": "xlarge", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.xlarge" },
        { "value": "maximum", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.maximum" }
      ],
      "default": "medium"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "vertical_gap",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.vertical_gap_label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.vertical_gap_info",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.direction == 'vertical' }}",
      "options": [
        { "value": "inherit", "label": "t:blocks.group.vertical_gap_inherit" },
        { "value": "none", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.none" },
        { "value": "minimal", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.minimal" },
        { "value": "tiny", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.tiny" },
        { "value": "small", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.small" },
        { "value": "medium", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.medium" },
        { "value": "large", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.large" },
        { "value": "xlarge", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.xlarge" },
        { "value": "maximum", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.maximum" }
      ],
      "default": "inherit"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "padding",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.padding.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.padding.info",
      "options": [
        { "value": "none", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.none" },
        { "value": "minimal", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.minimal" },
        { "value": "tiny", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.tiny" },
        { "value": "small", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.small" },
        { "value": "medium", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.medium" },
        { "value": "large", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.large" },
        { "value": "xlarge", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.xlarge" },
        { "value": "maximum", "label": "t:blocks.all.step.maximum" }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_borders",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.show_borders_label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.show_borders_info",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:blocks.group.border_settings_header",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "group_border_width",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.border_width_label",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 10,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 1,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "border_color",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.border_color_label",
      "info": "t:blocks.group.border_color_info",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "border_top",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.border_top_label",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "border_right",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.border_right_label",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "border_bottom",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.border_bottom_label",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "border_left",
      "label": "t:blocks.group.border_left_label",
      "default": true,
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_borders }}"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:blocks.group.name",
      "settings": {
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "distribute": "between",
        "align": "baseline",
        "wrap": true,
        "items_width": "natural",
        "items_height": "natural",
        "stack_below": "mobile",
        "content_alignment": "inherit",
        "content_alignment_mobile": "inherit",
        "gap": "medium",
        "vertical_gap": "inherit",
        "padding": "none",
        "show_borders": false,
        "group_border_width": 1,
        "border_top": true,
        "border_right": true,
        "border_bottom": true,
        "border_left": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
